    {
      "id": "gMfSUhigNm0SApzyVX2px",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1149.7954782992697,
      "y": -2129.7787342224765,
      "width": 712.6400756835938,
      "height": 65.50189984394763,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b27",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 759453538,
      "version": 584,
      "versionNonce": 1453714878,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605707017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "没有异常(中断)时：\n        依然是一个硬编码完成的一段连续的程序，逻辑无问题",
      "fontSize": 26.20075993757905,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "没有异常(中断)时：\n        依然是一个硬编码完成的一段连续的程序，逻辑无问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "67fvvRxb3a0cqRQCLMMXe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1149.7954776507859,
      "y": -1992.2811109050845,
      "width": 1004.7175903320312,
      "height": 131.00379968789525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b28",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2068257570,
      "version": 967,
      "versionNonce": 1095193890,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605707017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "有异常(中断)时：\n         ① 是在程序运行时突然发生的，caller 无法完成 “caller 保存” 的任务，这部分\n         由硬件自动完成，异常/中断程序 依然遵循 callee调用约定\n         ② 可能出现逻辑混乱的问题",
      "fontSize": 26.20075993757905,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "有异常(中断)时：\n         ① 是在程序运行时突然发生的，caller 无法完成 “caller 保存” 的任务，这部分\n         由硬件自动完成，异常/中断程序 依然遵循 callee调用约定\n         ② 可能出现逻辑混乱的问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uF4AfLyDnklDOljtjTZTe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2005.9691050850506,
      "y": -3258.611167843658,
      "width": 236,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
